NAME
     kl - KL-11 or DL-11 asynchronous interface

DESCRIPTION
     The discussion of terminal I/O given in _t_t_y(4) applies to
     these devices.

     Since they run at a constant speed, attempts to change the
     speed via _i_o_c_t_l(2) are ignored.

FILES
     /dev/ttyk[0-9a-f]

SEE ALSO
     tty(4)

BUGS
     Modem control for the DL-11E is not implemented.





































